# Trystan's Command, modes 1 and 4: "Create a token that's a copy of target Elf you control" and "Creatures target player controls get
# +3/+3 until end of turn. Untap them." Bot1 controls an Elvish Mystic (an Elf, tapped for mana to pay for the Command) and an Ornithopter,
# Bot2 its own Llanowar Elves. Refused for the copy: Bot2's Elf (not "you control") and Bot1's Ornithopter (not an Elf). Modes happen in
# printed order (CR 700.2d) and the pump takes the creatures there are as it resolves (CR 611.2c), so the token copy is a 4/4 too, and
# "them" is those creatures: the Mystic is untapped again. Bot2's Elf stays 1/1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Elvish Mystic
Ornithopter
Island
Island
Trystan's Command
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Island x18

